    <item>
      <title>Chiefs 35, Jets 12: Kenneth Walker scores 3 TDs as Kansas City snaps its 2-game skid and holds New York to minus-9 third-quarter yards</title>
      <link>https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:30:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://espnmedia-cdn.akamaized.net/espn/media/common/2026/1108/04082e318c864f10b464e649c74cace4989/04082e318c864f10b464e649c74cace4989.jpg" alt="Kenneth Walker scores for the Chiefs against the Jets" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Walker posted 143 scrimmage yards and his third career three-TD game; Mahomes threw for 242 yards and 2 TDs, and Mahomes-to-Kelce passed Rivers-to-Gates as the most prolific QB-TE yardage duo in NFL history at 9,365.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;You're coming off two losses there, and I felt like we had a good week of practice, and they didn't hang their heads. My hat goes off to the guys.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045">Andy Reid, Chiefs head coach</a></blockquote>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Honestly, the first half we were making a lot of mistakes. At halftime, we straightened everything out.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045">Kenneth Walker III, Chiefs running back</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045">ESPN/AP recap</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.chiefs.com/news/chiefs-defeat-jets-35-12-behind-ken-walker-s-three-touchdown-performance-">Chiefs.com</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/9%3A%20loved%20%22Chiefs%2035%2C%20Jets%2012%3A%20Kenneth%20Walker%20scor...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/9%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Chiefs%2035%2C%20Jets%2012%3A%20Kenneth%20Walker%20scor...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/9%3A%20less%20like%20%22Chiefs%2035%2C%20Jets%2012%3A%20Kenneth%20Walker%20scor...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
