    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Mahomes escapes an elbow scare after a grotesque bend on a strip-sack, plans more testing; Xavier Worthy exits late with a hamstring injury</title>
      <link>https://www.si.com/nfl/chiefs/onsi/chiefs-relieved-not-out-of-woods-after-patrick-mahomes-injury-against-jets</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.si.com/nfl/chiefs/onsi/chiefs-relieved-not-out-of-woods-after-patrick-mahomes-injury-against-jets</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Chiefs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://images2.minutemediacdn.com/image/upload/c_crop,x_305,y_157,w_4360,h_2452/c_fill,w_720,ar_16:9,f_auto,q_auto,g_auto/images/ReutersImages/mmsport/arrowhead_report/01m6ygpk642tye9ke6ds.jpg" alt="Patrick Mahomes throws under pressure against the Jets" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>David Bailey's second sack in three plays bent Mahomes' right elbow badly; trainer Julie Frymyer worked on it at halftime and Mahomes finished the game. RT Jaylen Moore also hurt an ankle, and Worthy's hamstring is the one to watch with the trade deadline Tuesday.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;If I'm able to play, I'm going to play. That's part of the game.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045">Patrick Mahomes, Chiefs quarterback</a></blockquote>
<blockquote>&ldquo;Once I threw the football, I knew I was OK.&rdquo; - <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045">Mahomes, who planned more testing on the elbow after the game</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.si.com/nfl/chiefs/onsi/chiefs-relieved-not-out-of-woods-after-patrick-mahomes-injury-against-jets">Sports Illustrated</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.espn.com/nfl/recap/_/gameId/401873045">ESPN/AP recap</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/9%3A%20loved%20%22Mahomes%20escapes%20an%20elbow%20scare%20after%20a...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/9%3A%20meh%20on%20%22Mahomes%20escapes%20an%20elbow%20scare%20after%20a...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/9%3A%20less%20like%20%22Mahomes%20escapes%20an%20elbow%20scare%20after%20a...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//www.si.com/nfl/chiefs/onsi/chiefs-relieved-not-out-of-woods-after-patrick-mahomes-injury-against-jets%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
