      <title>Cloudflare's new example runs OpenAI's Codex agent loop inside a Durable Object, compiling Codex's Rust turn-processing to WebAssembly</title>
      <link>https://developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-11-09-codex-harness/</link>
