    <item>
      <title>Chesir smashes the Málaga Marathon women's record by 3:26 with a 2:21:17; Waithira edges the men's race in 2:08:17</title>
      <link>https://www.watchathletics.com/article/13865/waithira-wins-m-laga-thriller-as-chesir-breaks-women-s-record</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.watchathletics.com/article/13865/waithira-wins-m-laga-thriller-as-chesir-breaks-women-s-record</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 15:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>Running</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://www.watchathletics.com/userfiles/images/marathons%20road%20races/__thumbs/malaga-marathon-winner-1000px.jpg/malaga-marathon-winner-1000px__800x534.jpg" alt="Málaga Marathon winner" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Rebecca Kangogo Chesir led a Kenyan sweep of the women's podium on a redesigned, flatter course; the top three men finished within 38 seconds, with Simon Njuguna Waithira eight seconds clear of Victor Kiplimo.</b></p>
