      <title>King tides are already flooding the Embarcadero, and SF's October sea level ran a record 12.4 inches above NOAA predictions</title>
      <link>https://www.axios.com/local/san-francisco/2026/11/09/flood-risk-embarcadero</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.axios.com/local/san-francisco/2026/11/09/flood-risk-embarcadero</guid>
